Mate Sand Learn (mate-sand-learn) is a modified version of Sandboard
(https://github.com/scottstts/Sandboard) by Scott Sun, licensed under GPL-3.0-only.

Upstream: https://sand.scottsun.io
Also adapted via Sand BG (https://sand-bg.pages.dev) and Mate Sand Glass
(https://mate-sand-glass.pages.dev).

This derivative keeps the Sandboard WebGPU height-bed solver, airborne grains,
and lighting. Experiment 1 paints vocabulary polaroid cards under the sand and
shapes the packed height with gentle dunes and wind ripples. The sand simulation
and rendering engine are Sandboard’s. There is no Sandboard badge in the page
chrome; attribution lives here, in LICENSE, and in the README.

Content: @mate_mattt / MateMatt.

